ks a bit tired, bags under her eyes but she still greets Miho happily. Miho has come to help Alisa with her manuscript. Miho sits down at the table and realises that the manuscript is too small, since Alisa is a small fairy. She stares at it, confused on what to do. The comic is meant to be comedic.\nFeel free to make any adjustments as you wish.\nThank you very much in advance!\n\nMiho: https://photos.app.goo.gl/oGY5q8NHZAWvv1AUA\nAlisa: https://photos.app.goo.gl/5nG89M2fYF6M4wmc9\nReference: https://photos.app.goo.gl/TGh7AY9LpFbN25xj8", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@aoedamame/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9e272e3a/uploads/origins/86274f03-3ff5-4521-b593-dfa13c189c52?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ea64e07b64297a3cd9c0fcd566c8ee26", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9e272e3a/uploads/origins/86274f03-3ff5-4521-b593-dfa13c189c52?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ea64e07b64297a3cd9c0fcd566c8ee26, https://si.imgix.net/9e272e3a/uploads/origins/86274f03-3ff5-4521-b593-dfa13c189c52?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d05c80a6f18c9519793fb6a9cb9c47e9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9e272e3a/uploads/origins/86274f03-3ff5-4521-b593-dfa13c189c52?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f476af5e4cccc79f8b694b61ccf5c760 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "原神のロサリアのアフロだるまをお願いします", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@aoedamame/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/74d4d3dd/uploads/origins/fce97247-73b3-4657-b9cf-55a2d04482bd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=361935f62e9036d0acd3b76fdc50a80b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/74d4d3dd/uploads/origins/fce97247-73b3-4657-b9cf-55a2d04482bd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=361935f62e9036d0acd3b76fdc50a80b, https://si.imgix.net/74d4d3dd/uploads/origins/fce97247-73b3-4657-b9cf-55a2d04482bd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8272b1ad70696c852bff58ebbc6d9820 2x, https://si.imgix.net/74d4d3dd/uploads/origins/fce97247-73b3-4657-b9cf-55a2d04482bd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=42f618dc689705d7b35185ebdf866d4d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、あなたのアピールを読み、私のOCを描くことに興味を持ってくれたことに感謝します！\n以下は彼女の参考資料です。https://imgur.com/a/jQHkqiG\nポーズや表情はお好きなように。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@aoedamame/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a45325ff/uploads/origins/db3d7c8a-3039-49a5-81e2-f0672a086dae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ca485941ee6bb360dfacd5a26d07b88b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a45325ff/uploads/origins/db3d7c8a-3039-49a5-81e2-f0672a086dae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ca485941ee6bb360dfacd5a26d07b88b, https://si.imgix.net/a45325ff/uploads/origins/db3d7c8a-3039-49a5-81e2-f0672a086dae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4f5bf0c8932428aace172cbd197851dd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a45325ff/uploads/origins/db3d7c8a-3039-49a5-81e2-f0672a086dae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=413b586444d45431b18743a186db374e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、\nアピールをありがとうございます！アテナ、ティオナ、ミホの3人のOCをお願いしたいのですが、よろしいでしょうか？他の作品と似たような漫画（https://x.com/aoedamame/status/1764863008948490583)\nミホとティオナはアテナが小さくて可愛いので溺愛していて、アテナは2人の間に挟まれていて、他の2人に比べて身長もバストもかなり小さいので嫉妬している様子。主旨はコメディです。\n自由に調整してください。作品を楽しみにしています！\n\nアテナ：https://photos.app.goo.gl/voNwgpvLYJQAuVYw5\nティオナ：https://photos.app.goo.gl/LETe7irs1cRXcwW9A\nミホ: https://photos.app.goo.gl/oGY5q8NHZAWvv1AUA", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@aoedamame/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6ee06f17/uploads/origins/35ac3099-fd3c-464e-a874-1b7e18c2d98e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=69cbdd09a53cdd97731df6a1c96495c3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6ee06f17/uploads/origins/35ac3099-fd3c-464e-a874-1b7e18c2d98e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=69cbdd09a53cdd97731df6a1c96495c3, https://si.imgix.net/6ee06f17/uploads/origins/35ac3099-fd3c-464e-a874-1b7e18c2d98e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6f37e40d17ef7b7bbe09ff79869d9877 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6ee06f17/uploads/origins/35ac3099-fd3c-464e-a874-1b7e18c2d98e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a97b3e2d34d24f7594abaa76c517501f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！それではお言葉に甘えてうちの子のYK(ケイ)を描いて頂いてもよろしいでしょうか?\n衣装やポーズはお任せ致します。\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-gucTb-L1gT3ykoFk3dC0c4CwON6eWLd\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-gucTb-L1gT3ykoFk3dC0c4CwON6eWLd", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@aoedamame/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f7fb932d/uploads/origins/cf729124-e9a9-4bb2-b452-99fbf92da164?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7b235a296fe3f77a52935a26f89e7a95", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f7fb932d/uploads/origins/cf729124-e9a9-4bb2-b452-99fbf92da164?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7b235a296fe3f77a52935a26f89e7a95, https://si.imgix.net/f7fb932d/uploads/origins/cf729124-e9a9-4bb2-b452-99fbf92da164?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b157b19aa171985908ae0905e830d6cc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f7fb932d/uploads/origins/cf729124-e9a9-4bb2-b452-99fbf92da164?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cd59574b8212aa3a504f34dfac582b05 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "爽さん初めまして！アピールありがとうございます。\nイドなら彼女のガンプレイを見せようはどう思う？\n彼女が右手で銃を回せて